  m_text: "<color=#C24E18>3D art</color>  KayKit by Kay Lousberg (Restaurant Bits,
    City Builder, Forest, Characters, Animations) and Tiny Treats by Isa Lousberg
    (Bakery Interior, Baked Goods, House Plants). CC0.\n<color=#C24E18>Interface</color> 
